   "usage": {
    "title": "Using Jitsi Meet",
    "html": "<p>Using Jitsi Meet is straightforward, as it's browser based. Head over to <a href=\"https://meet.jit.si\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">meet.jit.si</a> and give it a try. It's scalable and free to use. All you need is a Google, Facebook or GitHub account in order to start a meeting. All browsers are supported!</p>\n<p>Using mobile? No problem, you can either use your mobile web browser or our fully-featured\nmobile apps:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\">Android</th>\n<th align=\"center\">Android (F-Droid)</th>\n<th align=\"center\">iOS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.jitsi.meet\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jitsi/jitsi-meet/master/resources/img/google-play-badge.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"50\" /></a></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://f-droid.org/packages/org.jitsi.meet/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jitsi/jitsi-meet/master/resources/img/f-droid-badge.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"50\" /></a></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/jitsi-meet/id1165103905\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jitsi/jitsi-meet/master/resources/img/appstore-badge.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"50\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>If you are feeling adventurous and want to get an early scoop of the features as they are being\ndeveloped you can also sign up for our open beta testing here:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://play.google.com/apps/testing/org.jitsi.meet\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Android</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://testflight.apple.com/join/isy6ja7S\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iOS</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "truncated": false,
